      "details": "<p><span>During the second century BCE, a tetrapolis was formed, of which Kibyra was the chief polity. The cities of Bubon, Balbura, and Oinoanda were included in the tetrapolis. This tetrapolis was broken up after the first Mithridatic War (89-85 BCE).</span></p>",
